  "_comment": "Z-Image Turbo - INPAINT. Right-click the Load Image node -> 'Open in MaskEditor', paint over the area to change, save. The prompt describes what should appear IN the masked area. GrowMask feathers the edge so the seam blends. SetLatentNoiseMask limits sampling to the mask; denoise 0.9 lets it change fully. Default input image is example.png (bundled ComfyUI sample); override with run_workflow.py --input-image image=<your file>."
